{"product_id":"country-of-the-blind","title":"Country of the Blind","description":"\u003cp\u003eHang These Bastards Now! The headline of one now-ownerless Tory tabloid - the bastards in question being the 4 men who'd allegedly committed 4 murders in the course of a burglary. Along with his wife and 2 bodyguards, Roland Voss, the tabloid owner and millionaire media mogul, has had a country weekend in Perthshire cut short by a cut throat. Suggestions that Voss might have been whacked on purpose pique investigative journalist Jack Parlabane's nose for a conspiracy. And he's not the only one who thinks the accused might be innocent... Fiendishly constructed, with dialogue as sharp as the plotting, Country of the Blind brilliantly reveals a world of danger and deceit, murder and betrayal, where defence is not a legal game but a fight for your life. A world that Jack Parlabane knows well. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:126 x 198  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Christopher Brookmyre \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780349109305 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 416\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43518502404249,"sku":"14RA9780349109305","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/03e5249486d6f30b32a7f660d066c884.jpg?v=1698046308","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/country-of-the-blind","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}